-Spain- Cataluña Stadium

01:51.180 --> 01:55.380
Mini Stadium of Cataluña's B Team

02:03.100 --> 02:07.340
Tsubasa! Tsubasa! Tsubasa!

02:10.300 --> 02:11.660
Tsubasa!

02:16.530 --> 02:17.780
Yes, go up the field!

02:18.340 --> 02:24.780
Only one goal to go, and Coach Edward's challenge of ten goals and ten assists will be met.

02:24.780 --> 02:28.550
Get rid of your marking and score that goal, Tsubasa!

02:30.340 --> 02:30.820
Good!

02:45.300 --> 02:50.300
He did it! Tsubasa just scored ten goals and he has ten assists! He's cleared the condition!

02:51.020 --> 02:51.860
Nice!

03:03.020 --> 03:08.780
He's got ten goals and ten assists. That was faster than I thought.

03:16.950 --> 03:19.830
I've done it, Coach Edward.

03:24.420 --> 03:29.540
<b>Dream Field</b>

03:24.420 --> 03:29.540
<b>Dream Field</b>

03:30.020 --> 03:34.140
Brazil - São Paulo

03:37.750 --> 03:39.430
Roberto, good morning.

03:39.430 --> 03:40.310
Morning.

03:48.290 --> 03:53.060
Ten goals and ten assists. You've done it, Tsubasa.

03:53.060 --> 03:58.240
How did they dare to put someone who was a star in Brazil in Spain's Second Division?

03:58.240 --> 04:01.300
Tsubasa should hurry back and play in Brazil.

04:01.300 --> 04:05.770
Tsubasa has cleared Coach Edward's challenge.

04:05.770 --> 04:08.300
It's now certain that he'll make it to the first team.

04:08.300 --> 04:10.110
Of course.

04:10.110 --> 04:14.590
Without Tsubasa, Cataluña will be in trouble.

04:14.590 --> 04:15.450
Eh?

04:15.450 --> 04:17.350
Against Santana.

04:19.490 --> 04:20.770
Santana, eh?

04:20.770 --> 04:26.900


04:26.900 --> 04:30.180
-Spain- San José's Press Conference

04:35.760 --> 04:41.340
Carlos Santana, a cool-headed player called the Soccer Cyborg

04:42.010 --> 04:46.120
and Tsubasa's biggest rival in Brazil, has come to Spain, huh?

04:47.230 --> 04:52.230
He also quickly transferred to FC San José, who are battling FC Cataluña for the championship.

04:54.350 --> 04:59.430
If I could get to the point, Santana, you've arrived to FC San José this season.

04:59.430 --> 05:05.690
Your rivals, FC Cataluña, have the Brazilian national team's ace, Rivaul, on their team.

05:05.690 --> 05:09.100
Will we witness a duel against him?

05:09.460 --> 05:13.370
I am honored to be able to play against the hero of my motherland, Brazil,

05:13.370 --> 05:17.980
but I don't think my only formidable opponent from FC Cataluña will be Rivaul.

05:20.490 --> 05:23.140
Who might you be talking about?

05:24.680 --> 05:28.140
Tsubasa Ohzora also plays at FC Cataluña.

05:29.630 --> 05:31.140
Tsubasa Ohzora!

05:31.140 --> 05:35.500
Tsubasa? Do you mean <i>the</i> Tsubasa from FC Cataluña's B Team?

05:36.250 --> 05:44.660
I came to Spain in order to go up against Tsubasa Ohzora, my biggest rival.

05:53.630 --> 05:56.620
I can't wait to once again play on the field...

05:57.620 --> 05:59.480
against Tsubasa Ohzora.

06:10.190 --> 06:11.430
Tsubasa-kun.

06:12.210 --> 06:14.560
Congratulations on scoring ten goals and getting ten assists.

06:15.450 --> 06:18.850
You'll now be able to play in the stadium of your dreams.

06:19.560 --> 06:20.760
Good luck!

06:28.700 --> 06:33.220
Gentlemen, after four years, it's time for the International Cup again.

06:33.730 --> 06:38.940
The national teams are calling their players for friendly games before the tournament.

06:38.940 --> 06:43.860
It will be necessary to check the schedule for every player and plan for replacements.

06:43.860 --> 06:51.060
I would also like your opinions on how to maintain our top position in Division I.

06:51.860 --> 06:55.880
Rivaul will have to leave us often.

06:55.880 --> 06:57.290
His absence will have a huge impact.

06:57.860 --> 07:01.300
Coach Edward, what are your thoughts on that matter?

07:01.850 --> 07:08.270
Yes. I would like to move Tsubasa Ohzora from the B team into the first team

07:08.270 --> 07:10.780
to compensate for Rivaul's absence.

07:11.910 --> 07:13.780
Tsubasa, eh?

07:14.150 --> 07:18.250
But if we want to be champions of both divisions,

07:18.250 --> 07:21.190
isn't it better to leave Tsubasa on the B Team?

07:21.760 --> 07:27.180
No. I believe only Tsubasa can replace Rivaul.

07:54.700 --> 07:58.340
Tsubasa, you'll be the playmaker,

07:59.930 --> 08:02.540
but on the reserve team.

08:06.260 --> 08:09.230
Tsubasa wanted the playmaker position,

08:09.230 --> 08:16.660
so he's been instructed to score ten goals, and have at least ten assists during the year.

08:18.660 --> 08:20.180
Damn it!

08:26.680 --> 08:29.780
That humiliation feels so far away.

08:30.890 --> 08:31.940
All right.

09:04.690 --> 09:08.220
Tsubasa, you've cleared the conditions  I gave you.

09:08.770 --> 09:09.740
Yes.

09:10.510 --> 09:13.420
From tomorrow on, you'll be on the first team.

09:14.850 --> 09:17.680
In two days, we'll be up against FC San José.

09:18.280 --> 09:20.020
Be ready.

09:20.020 --> 09:21.000
Yes!

09:23.750 --> 09:25.380
About your position.

09:27.860 --> 09:30.560
If you had answered that you only wanted to play,

09:30.560 --> 09:33.820
you would have been on the first team from the start of the season.

09:33.820 --> 09:37.820
But, at that time, you said you wanted to be the playmaker.

09:37.820 --> 09:41.250
That was a good decision, one that suits you.

09:41.250 --> 09:45.340
I can't imagine you playing any other position either.

09:47.340 --> 09:54.060
But, to be the best playmaker in the world, you'll have to progress more.

09:54.060 --> 09:57.550
Instead of being a bench warmer on the first team,

09:57.550 --> 10:00.840
you have to play out there on the field to gain experience.

10:03.850 --> 10:05.540
Thank you very much.

10:24.760 --> 10:32.340
I will finally be able to play on the field of my dreams!

10:59.420 --> 11:02.020
Good luck, Cataluña!

11:08.960 --> 11:15.020
I will finally be able to see Tsubasa play in this main stadium!

11:23.710 --> 11:26.660
Tsubasa isn't starting?

11:26.660 --> 11:31.260
Rivaul, if you run out of steam, there's a guy on the bench ready to take your place.

11:31.260 --> 11:33.770
Hurry up and come onto the field, Tsubasa!

11:33.770 --> 11:37.260
I've come here to play against you!

11:49.990 --> 11:55.570
I want to leap out onto this field to play against Santana!

12:04.770 --> 12:06.530
Will Tsubasa play?

12:09.170 --> 12:11.740
If there's a chance, for sure.

12:17.740 --> 12:20.850
Tsubasa-kun! Show Tsubasa-kun!

12:23.580 --> 12:25.260
Tsubasa-kun!

12:25.260 --> 12:28.420
Good luck, Tsubasa-kun!

12:29.460 --> 12:31.790
We're nearing the midway point of the Spanish League's season,

12:31.790 --> 12:36.420
and the game between FC Cataluña and FC San José will start soon.

12:37.690 --> 12:41.920
Carlos Santana, who just transferred from the Brazilian club, Domingo,

12:41.920 --> 12:45.620
has already gotten a starting place as a forward for San José.

12:46.310 --> 12:51.560
And up against him is Rivaul, the ace from his home country's national team.

12:52.500 --> 12:57.900
And with this Rivaul-Santana matchup, 
two generations of soccer players will collide.

12:58.620 --> 13:02.870
In addition, Japan's Ohzora Tsubasa is on the bench for this game.

13:02.870 --> 13:08.900
We can't wait to see how the famous Coach Edward will use him in this game.

13:09.770 --> 13:11.540
The game has now started.

13:16.900 --> 13:18.660
Oh, Cataluña intercepts the ball.

13:19.460 --> 13:22.130
But San José takes it back.

13:21.100 --> 13:23.300
Aimor, let's go!

13:26.370 --> 13:29.820
The ball is being sent to the left side.  Will it reach Aimor?

13:30.540 --> 13:33.780
It has been cleared! Clemente sends it far up the field.

13:33.780 --> 13:35.660
The ball floats towards Santana in the middle!

13:38.630 --> 13:41.500
Oh, the anticipated duel is here already!

13:45.900 --> 13:47.650
The ball is still in play.

13:48.850 --> 13:52.060
Rivaul traps the loose ball.

13:52.720 --> 13:54.780
Just as expected from him.

13:56.780 --> 13:59.480
Rivaul dribbles up the field.

13:59.480 --> 14:02.780
Santana is following, just behind him.

14:03.540 --> 14:05.540
I'll have fun with this game.

14:07.290 --> 14:08.920
The ball gets passed to the left side.

14:08.920 --> 14:11.330
Albert rushes over there!

14:11.330 --> 14:14.660
Oh, that's tough marking, 
and Albert doesn't make it.

14:14.660 --> 14:17.890
The ball crosses the touch line, and it's a throw-in for San José.

14:22.220 --> 14:26.130
Mendez sends the ball towards the center, and Santana traps the long pass.

14:26.130 --> 14:29.420
He's already the pillar of this team.

14:29.420 --> 14:32.420
Rivaul is marking Santana.

14:32.420 --> 14:34.540
Let's go at it for real!

14:43.820 --> 14:45.340
He's doing the Santana Turn!

14:46.820 --> 14:49.820
Tsubasa already showed me that feint once!

14:50.900 --> 14:52.140
He's going for an overhead shot!

14:54.860 --> 14:58.340
Wow! The two men collide in mid-air!

15:00.380 --> 15:03.380
Santana's movements have gotten faster.

15:04.460 --> 15:05.700
It's still not over.

15:08.710 --> 15:11.060
That's your bad habit.

15:11.060 --> 15:15.140
As soon as you see someone who has some skills, you want to go up against him.

15:17.770 --> 15:21.740
Our job is to defend! You need to concentrate on scoring goals!

15:22.310 --> 15:23.500
I've got it.

15:28.000 --> 15:30.020
Rivaul...

15:30.560 --> 15:32.600
Rivaul-san and Santana.

15:32.600 --> 15:37.860
Without doubt, they will be two pillars for Brazil during the International Cup.

15:38.580 --> 15:39.860
When that time comes,

15:40.750 --> 15:43.460
I'll have to go up against both of them.

15:43.460 --> 15:46.460
Now Cataluña is attacking.

15:46.460 --> 15:48.980
Grandios is advancing up the right side.

15:49.590 --> 15:51.860
Grandios sends a long pass over to the opposite side.

15:51.860 --> 15:53.990
This is a great chance for Cataluña!

15:56.660 --> 15:58.820
Albert crosses it in front of goal!

15:57.580 --> 15:58.810
Darn it!

15:58.820 --> 15:59.890
It's too high!

15:59.890 --> 16:02.420
But the ball's too high!

16:00.980 --> 16:01.770
Good!

16:01.770 --> 16:02.420
Oh!

16:07.100 --> 16:08.620
Yes!

16:08.620 --> 16:09.860
Good.

16:09.860 --> 16:13.130
It's in! It's a goal!

16:13.130 --> 16:15.970
Cataluña scores the first goal in their home game.

16:15.970 --> 16:19.900
It's a goal worthy of Cataluña's hawk, Rivaul!

16:22.240 --> 16:26.970
Grandios sent a long pass flying from the midfield.

16:26.970 --> 16:29.460
Albert centered the ball instantly.

16:30.640 --> 16:33.500
And Rivaul-san scored the goal without hesitation.

16:33.500 --> 16:34.660
And...

16:35.270 --> 16:36.640
Santana!

16:44.900 --> 16:47.150
The game resumes with San José kicking off.

16:48.220 --> 16:50.160
Santana already has the ball!

16:49.100 --> 16:50.940
I'm going at him!

16:52.940 --> 16:54.420
Eh, what?

16:53.570 --> 16:57.660
Oh, Alaberdo and the defender Bazal are both getting passed in the blink of an eye!

16:58.050 --> 17:00.780
Clemente, Gonzales, Almieja, he's coming!

17:00.780 --> 17:01.380
All right.

17:01.380 --> 17:02.300
Leave him to us!

17:02.300 --> 17:03.070
Let's do this!

17:09.720 --> 17:12.260
Santana evades Almieja's sliding tackle!

17:12.820 --> 17:14.780
But he loses his balance!

17:20.540 --> 17:21.180
What!?

17:30.380 --> 17:34.660
He's been stopped! Grandios came to block the ball!

17:33.900 --> 17:34.660
It's not over yet!

17:34.660 --> 17:35.300
What!?

17:36.780 --> 17:39.100
What a fierce battle for the ball!

17:40.000 --> 17:42.940
The ball is my friend, and I won't give it to anyone!

17:49.100 --> 17:51.520
Santana scored!

17:51.520 --> 17:55.140
He's already scored in his Spanish debut!

17:55.140 --> 17:58.340
San José scores the equalizing goal. The game is tied!

18:23.960 --> 18:25.660
I will never give up no matter the situation.

18:29.270 --> 18:30.660
Wherever I go,

18:30.660 --> 18:33.660
I need to keep the good feeling I get from playing soccer.

18:35.380 --> 18:39.020
With soccer, I can't waste a single minute.

18:41.080 --> 18:45.220
I will have to go at it with everything I've got!

18:47.220 --> 18:51.740
Oh! Cataluña has been given a free kick from a great position.

18:51.740 --> 18:55.770
Even though Santana, San José's new ace, scored,

18:55.770 --> 18:58.740
Cataluña's defense held strong afterwards.

18:59.220 --> 19:01.500
They have to take advantage of this chance to score!

19:01.500 --> 19:05.480
The one to shoot this will, of course, be their ace, Rivaul.

19:06.910 --> 19:10.180
Is he aiming to shoot over the wall? Or...

19:16.580 --> 19:17.300
Over us?

19:31.060 --> 19:32.100
Rivaul-san!

19:34.980 --> 19:40.260
San José rapidly clears the ball and passes it to Santana in order to counterattack.

19:38.700 --> 19:40.250
That's as far as you get!

19:40.250 --> 19:41.380
You won't get through!

19:42.620 --> 19:44.020
The Santana Turn?

19:44.020 --> 19:45.700
The same trick won't work twice!

19:55.280 --> 19:57.420
Goal!

19:57.000 --> 19:59.060
Yeah!

19:57.420 --> 20:00.940
Aimor, the Argentinian, splendidly scored!

20:00.320 --> 20:00.940
Nice.

20:01.900 --> 20:04.220
San José takes the lead.

20:06.850 --> 20:10.580
Oh, what's this? Rivaul is still on the ground in front of San José's goal.

20:10.580 --> 20:15.660
Did he get injured somewhere during his duel in front of San José's goal?

20:17.080 --> 20:19.460
He has to be taken off the field.

20:21.510 --> 20:22.340
Tsubasa.

20:24.400 --> 20:25.220
Go out there.

20:25.220 --> 20:26.220
Yes, sir!

20:30.930 --> 20:33.220
Cataluña is making a player substitution.

20:33.220 --> 20:36.100
Number 28 will be replacing Rivaul...

20:35.100 --> 20:37.690
Awesome! It's Tsubasa! Tsubasa gets to play!

20:36.100 --> 20:39.700
Ohzora Tsubasa finally gets his chance to play on this field.

20:40.470 --> 20:44.570
Tsubasa, that's the Spanish League you've chosen.

20:44.570 --> 20:46.460
Go out there and have lots of fun!

20:46.460 --> 20:48.030
Awesome!

20:48.640 --> 20:51.380
All right! Go, Tsubasa-kun!

20:54.420 --> 20:55.650
It's Tsubasa!

20:55.650 --> 20:56.900
He's getting ready to play!

20:59.600 --> 21:03.060
The time has finally arrived! Be sure to get every moment on film!

21:03.060 --> 21:04.360
Yes!

21:18.060 --> 21:20.940
Tsubasa, go out there and have fun!

21:38.730 --> 21:39.980
This is it!

21:39.980 --> 21:41.700
This is where I belong!

21:45.490 --> 21:47.460
There you are, Tsubasa.

21:48.370 --> 21:50.520
I'm finally battling on this field...

21:55.860 --> 21:57.500
It's the best feeling!

21:57.500 --> 21:59.830
Isn't it, Santana?

22:04.020 --> 22:11.900
Preview

22:04.020 --> 22:11.900
Preview

22:05.510 --> 22:08.340
We're finally playing in the International Cup!

22:08.340 --> 22:10.550
This has always been our goal.

22:11.130 --> 22:13.740
The stadium echoes with cheering from our supporters

22:13.740 --> 22:17.130
who are waiting for us dressed in our blue jerseys.

22:17.130 --> 22:19.090
Let's go for it, guys!

22:19.090 --> 22:22.420
Let's make our dream of a championship win for Japan become a reality!

22:23.130 --> 22:26.020
Next time, on the last episode of Captain Tsubasa:

22:26.020 --> 22:27.900
Warriors on the Field.

22:26.180 --> 22:34.180
Warriors on the Field {TLC: is this the line that I've frequently been told to delete? I haven't yet figured out which one to delete when there are two titles.}

22:27.900 --> 22:29.660
Look forward to it!

22:29.660 --> 22:31.900
Let's face our future! Kick off!

